  "summary": "UniJEPA and PSG-JEPA: Unified and Physically Grounded Joint-Embedding Predictive Architectures, HandFlow: Fully Generative 4D Hand Recovery with Flow Matching, and GRC-Pose: Generation-Reconstruction Correspondence for Prior-Free 6D Object Pose Tracking",
